  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...8...10 spirit. Bleeding creatures within its range suffer -2 Health degeneration. When this spirit dies, all non-spirit creatures within its range that have less than 90% Health begin Bleeding for 5...21...25 seconds. This spirit dies after 30...198...240 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造一隻等級 1～10 的撕裂精靈。對區域內遭受「流血」病症的生物附加體力衰減 2 的效果。當撕裂精靈死亡時，區域內體力低於 90% 的生物將遭受「流血」病症 5～25 秒。撕裂精靈在 30～240 秒後消失。"
    },
